rooms_desc ({"This is a very comfortable room, with a warm hearth directly in front of you.Two staircases are on either side of hearth, which meet at a hallway.The room is adorned with many brilliant colors. The ceiling is also very high.There are many windows, which provide alot of natural light","hi","You have stepped into the dining room. There is an oval shapedtable with 6 chairs around it in the center of the room. Thereis a wall piano on the west wall. On the east wall is a door, anda china cabinet next to it.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.",0,0,0,0,0,})
